{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Shaddai</b> — its meaning is like מנצח, as the Nagid explained." "<b>And kings</b> — they are the kings of the earth, and in it dwells אל: \"your beasts dwell in it.\"" "<b>And snow</b> — the whiteness appears like the snow that is always found on Zalmon, and it is a known mountain found across the Jordan to the east." "<b>Why</b> — he recounts the praise of the land of Israel."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 68, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:08.404144490Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}